\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. I Hunger and I thirst;
\par Jesus, my manna be:
\par Ye living waters, burst
\par Out of the rock for me.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thou bruised and broken Bread,
\par My life-long wannts supply;
\par As living souls are fed,
\par O feed me, or I die.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Thou true life-giving Vine,
\par Let me Thy sweetness prove;
\par Renew my life with Thine,
\par Refresh my soul with love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Rough paths my feet have trod,
\par Since first their course began;
\par Feed me, Thou bread of God;
\par Help me, Thou Son of Man.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. For still the desert lies
\par My thirsting soul before;
\par O living waters rise
\par Within me evermore.   
\par                    Amen.
\par \lang1033\f1 
\par \cf1\lang1040\ul\b\f2 
\par }

